WEBVTT

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:05.200
Supreme!

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:59.330
of the universe. There once existed a planet known as Krypton, a planet that burned like a green star in the distant heavens.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:03.950
There, civilization was far advanced and had brought forth a race of supermen,

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:07.880
whose mental and physical powers were developed to the absolute peak of human perfection.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:12.480
But there came a day when giant quakes threatened to destroy Krypton forever.

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:15.670
One of the planet's leading scientists, sensing the approach of doom,

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.720
placed his infant son in a small rocket ship and sent it hurtling in the direction of the Earth.

00:01:19.900 --> 00:01:29.230
Just as Krypton exploded, the rocket ship sped through star-studded space.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:36.110
safely on earth with its precious burden, Krypton's sole survivor. A passing motorist found the

00:01:36.110 --> 00:01:41.300
uninjured child and took it to an orphanage. As the years went by and the child grew to maturity,

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:47.630
he found himself possessed of amazing physical powers. Faster than a speeding bullet, more powerful

00:01:47.630 --> 00:01:54.580
than a locomotive. Tall buildings at a single pound, the infant of Krypton is now the man of

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:59.980
steel, Superman, who best be in a position to use his amazing power.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.360
in a never-ending battle for truth and justice,

00:02:02.880 --> 00:02:05.320
Superman has assumed the disguise of Clark Kent,

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:08.250
mild-mannered reporter for a great metropolitan newspaper.

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:19.160
Good to see you.

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:21.230
Just received another threatening note.

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:22.290
