00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:48.670
who laughed at me and failed to heed my warnings. Beware, I strike at midnight.

00:02:49.130 --> 00:02:55.340
This nut may prove dangerous. Kent, you help Lois follow up her lead. She may

00:02:55.340 --> 00:02:59.980
have an angle on this thing. Yes, sir. But Chief, I'd like the chance to crack the...

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:10.470
story on my own. Thanks, Chief. But, Lois, Chief, don't you think that's a dangerous mission?

